{
  "summary": "The sequence shows two persistent objects: a transparent blue ring and a small wooden sphere with a blue band. The ring is manipulated by a metallic rod held from the right side, causing it to rotate, translate, and tilt in place. The wooden sphere moves independently, floating and changing position in 3D space near the ring. The camera remains static, with no noticeable rotation or translation. The sequence includes a clear instance of approach, contact (with uncertain exact time), sustained contact, contact release, and rebound, all between the ring (object 1) and the sphere (object 2).",
